<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-03T23:33:07.573Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 23:33:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila now leads a rebel coalition that includes M23, which has taken positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting with Congolese government forces. The United States has imposed sanctions on Rwanda's defence ministry and its military bank Zigama for supplying the rebels and is moving to remove Rwanda and South Africa from the AGOA duty-free trade programme. An Ebola outbreak in eastern DR Congo has killed more than 5,300 people, prompting WHO warnings of a continent-wide spread. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/south-africa-braces-for-some-job-losses-as-agoa-ends&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/why-south-africa-s-local-elections-matter/a-79842695?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c9j346xg0mkvo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/us-to-drop-south-africa-rwanda-from-duty-free-trade-initiative/a-79834508?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOUUVnTktQLVFfR0UzMDJoX3plVnBIT2R1TzlnY0w1U0IwckYtdzBIVTdubnRHNzZGbHJiV09rNWpUZ3Z3NGtMYkpWMWo3TjUzcXZqNThRNEt3d2dBX3NMTTZpVVhFTWlBNXgtNFo3cDNrWS1KdXkwOU5TMFRPWHV1NXZiVHlCLXg4WnRUUVFtSVZmU0RFMkhheTdPXzEwalFoWjRPNlYxd3FIWjdUZkNRZHktaVA1UXRXM0prb1JZX3E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPSFlCa1JJbEg2NlFPaGVVUjlqaHpzLVNDOG9xalhzRElnZ2N0aEdIRHJQT09sWmZvb2hfeC1uMGlLUjlBMWQyejV3SmpLQ